IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tulrca-types`
IMPORT `tulrca-periods`
IMPORT `tulrca-union`
IMPORT `tulrca-redundancy`

-- Trade Union and Labour Relations (Consolidation) Act 1992 (UK) — THE
-- TOP-LEVEL GOAL. Seat: the worker or employee.
--
--   "Am I protected for my union membership or activities, by when must I
--    complain, can I get interim relief, what is the least basic award? In a
--    collective redundancy, when should consultation have begun, what is my
--    protective award, and by when must I complain? Was my dismissal for
--    protected industrial action unfair, and by when must I complain?"

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Worker case` HAS
    `the union matter`                                  IS A MAYBE `Union case`
    `the redundancies`                                  IS A MAYBE `Redundancy case`
    `the industrial action`                             IS A MAYBE `Industrial action case`

DECLARE `Worker position` HAS
    `protected on union grounds`                        IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `qualifying period disapplied`                      IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `last day to complain of the detriment`             IS A MAYBE DATE
    `last day to apply for interim relief`              IS A MAYBE DATE
    `interim relief application in time`                IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `basic award before reductions`                     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `consultation required`                             IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `last day for consultation to begin`                IS A MAYBE DATE
    `consultation began in time`                        IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `first day of the protected period`                 IS A MAYBE DATE
    `last day of the protected period`                  IS A MAYBE DATE
    `remuneration under the protective award`           IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `last day for the protective award complaint`       IS A MAYBE DATE
    `last day to complain of non-payment`               IS A MAYBE DATE
    `industrial action dismissal unfair`                IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `last day to complain of the industrial action dismissal` IS A MAYBE DATE

@ref ss 146-161, 188-192, 238A-239, 292A
@export default The worker's position under the Trade Union and Labour Relations (Consolidation) Act 1992 (UK): whether a detriment or dismissal on union grounds is protected (ss 146, 152, 153), whether the qualifying period is disapplied (s 154), the last day to complain of a detriment (s 147, with s 292A), the last day for interim relief and whether the application is in time (s 161), and the basic award before reductions with the £9,157 minimum (s 156); in collective redundancies, whether consultation was required and began in time (s 188), the protected period and my remuneration under a protective award (ss 189-191), and the last days for the complaints (ss 189(5), 192(2), with s 292A); and whether a dismissal for protected industrial action is unfair (s 238A) and the last day to complain (s 239(2)). Each is NOTHING where its facts are not given. DRAFT, not reviewed by a UK lawyer.
GIVEN c IS A `Worker case`  @desc The union matter, any collective redundancies, and any industrial action dismissal
GIVETH A `Worker position`
`the worker position for` c MEANS
    `Worker position` WITH
        `protected on union grounds`                    IS
            CONSIDER c's `the union matter`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST u  THEN JUST (`I am protected under the union provisions` u)
        `qualifying period disapplied`                  IS
            CONSIDER c's `the union matter`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST u  THEN JUST (`the qualifying period is disapplied for` u)
        `last day to complain of the detriment`         IS
            CONSIDER c's `the union matter`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST u  THEN `the last day to complain of the detriment for` u
        `last day to apply for interim relief`          IS
            CONSIDER c's `the union matter`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST u  THEN `the last day to apply for interim relief for` u
        `interim relief application in time`            IS
            CONSIDER c's `the union matter`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST u  THEN JUST (`my interim relief application is in time for` u)
        `basic award before reductions`                 IS
            CONSIDER c's `the union matter`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST u  THEN JUST (`the basic award before reductions for` u)
        `consultation required`                         IS
            CONSIDER c's `the redundancies`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST r  THEN JUST (`consultation is required for` r)
        `last day for consultation to begin`            IS
            CONSIDER c's `the redundancies`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST r  THEN `the last day for consultation to begin for` r
        `consultation began in time`                    IS
            CONSIDER c's `the redundancies`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST r  THEN JUST (`consultation began in time for` r)
        `first day of the protected period`             IS
            CONSIDER c's `the redundancies`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST r  THEN
                CONSIDER r's `the award`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
                WHEN JUST a  THEN JUST (`the first day of the protected period for` r `under` a)
        `last day of the protected period`              IS
            CONSIDER c's `the redundancies`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST r  THEN
                CONSIDER r's `the award`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
                WHEN JUST a  THEN JUST (`the last day of the protected period for` r `under` a)
        `remuneration under the protective award`       IS
            CONSIDER c's `the redundancies`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST r  THEN
                CONSIDER r's `the award`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
                WHEN JUST a  THEN JUST (`my remuneration under` a)
        `last day for the protective award complaint`   IS
            CONSIDER c's `the redundancies`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST r  THEN JUST (`the last day for a protective award complaint for` r)
        `last day to complain of non-payment`           IS
            CONSIDER c's `the redundancies`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST r  THEN
                CONSIDER r's `the award`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
                WHEN JUST a  THEN `the last day to complain of non-payment under` a
        `industrial action dismissal unfair`            IS
            CONSIDER c's `the industrial action`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST i  THEN JUST (`my dismissal is unfair under s 238A for` i)
        `last day to complain of the industrial action dismissal` IS
            CONSIDER c's `the industrial action`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST i  THEN JUST (`the last day to complain of an industrial action dismissal for` i)
